{"sourceUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0429/c12332a367536/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:20.893899+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2025/0429/c12332a367536/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>一、</span></span></span><span><span>申请资格</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>全国高水平大学（含建有研究生院的大学）物理学相关专业的</span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生（含本校学生），对物理学科有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事物理学相关的科研工作；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格，拟申请到我校攻读研究生（含直博生）的</span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、具有较强学术研究能力的理工科推免生优先考虑。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、申请流程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span>申请形式</span></span></p><p><span><span>登录哈尔滨工业大学研究生招生网官方网站夏令营报名系统，直接报名。网址：</span></span><a href=\"http://hityzb.hit.edu.cn/zhxy-yjs-zs_v2/common/login?redirectUrl=/pc/xly/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://hityzb.hit.edu.cn/zhxy-yjs-zs_v2/common/login?redirectUrl=/pc/xly/index</span></span></a></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、报名时间</span></span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>日至</span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>日。</span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、申请材料</span></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span>网上申请需上传如下材料</span></span><span><span><span>jpg</span></span><span><span>或</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件，如附件较大导致无法上传，请直接将附件资料发至邮箱</span></span></span><span><span><span>1293367694@qq.com</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，附件文件命名格式：姓名－选报专业</span></span><span><span><span>方向</span></span></span><span><span>－毕业院校：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(1) </span></span><span><span>所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章成绩排名证明原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(2) </span></span><span><span>所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件，原件备查；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(3) </span></span><span><span>专家（副教授以上）书面推荐信</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>份，格式自定；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(4) </span></span><span><span>体现英语水平的证明材料（</span></span></span><span><span><span>CET6/TOEFL/GRE/ IELTS</span></span><span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>(5) </span></span><span><span>其他证明材料，包括：已发表论文中代表性论文</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>注：以上材料原件在入营时审核。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span>确定名单</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>物理</span></span></span><span><span>学院研究生招生工作领导小组根据申请者的网上报名信息，确定入选者名单，并实时通过网报系统和</span></span><span><span><span>邮件</span></span></span><span><span>方式通知夏令营入选者。</span></span><span><span><span>届时未入选者，不另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>请通过审核的同学务必</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span>18:00</span></span><span><span>前在报名端口确认参加，逾期不确认者将不予录取。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>三、</span>活动安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、报到时间：</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、报到地点：</span><span><span>哈工大一校区理学楼</span></span></span><span><span>829</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、活动内容：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>日：</span></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span>营员报到</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>日：</span></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span>上午：学院和学科介绍；招生政策宣讲</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>下午：学术研讨</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>晚上：全体营员联谊活动</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日：</span></span></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span><span><span>上午：参观校博物馆、航天馆</span></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span><span>下午：参观实验室、离营</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>四</span></span></span><span><span>、其他说明</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span><span><span>、学院将为营员提供夏令营期间在哈尔滨的食宿</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span><span>、感兴趣的营员可自愿选择在有意向的实验室停留一周，以深入了解学科</span><span><span>（</span></span><span>请提前和导师沟通好</span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span><span>、营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营的活动</span><span><span>。</span></span></s